//
// Learn the remote planner turns without prompt bytes. The remaining
// 95 events are the speaker that picks the next tool. That speaker
// already has Form organs: ground-first, native-then-local-then-remote,
// one-turn, form-run, mill-observe, land, no-transcript, pending.
// Cartesian on every query lane. Leakage 0. fqt-lora? stays 0.
